OL,3,GNEWSABin lorry dumps flaming load on to
OL,4,Astreet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bin lorry had to empty its load out
OL,7,Fon to the street after a fire broke
OL,8,Fout.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service was
OL,11,Fcalled to the waste alight in Ormonde
OL,12,FDrive on the Denby Hall Business Park
OL,13,Fin Ripley at about 11:30 BST on
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FCrews from Alfreton and Ripley wearing
OL,17,Fbreathing equipment hosed down the
OL,18,Ffire.
OL,20,FThe scene was left with the waste
OL,21,Foperator for clean-up, the fire service
OL,22,Fsaid.
